{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>אהה</b> — This word is uttered in fear. And Yefet said: for the alef is added." "<b>וכשוד</b> — The meaning: who can escape plunder that comes from HaShem?! And the Nagid, of blessed memory, said: that שוד is an adjective, like: עלי לבי דוי, except that the yod is in place of the letter of doubling, like: דליו שוקים מפסח, and the meaning is overpowering and victorious; therefore he said: for in this place it is not the revered Name, and similarly כקול מים רבים כקול שדי, and similarly: והיה שדי בצריך תקיף, and the proof: וכסף תועפות לך, and it is written: ושית על עפר בצר. And he spoke well."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:26.283373942Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}